        "text_yw6LrN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whether you're selecting a new pump, troubleshooting an electric motor, looking for replacement parts, or have questions about pricing and shipping, you'll find answers to many of our customers' most common questions below. </p><p><strong>If you need additional assistance, the experienced team at Dade Pump & Supply is here to help by phone or email.</strong></p>"
